From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:20:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add Duplicate action to dashboard page menu

Adds a "Duplicate" item to the dashboard's more options menu (for users
who can create dashboards). It opens a dialog prefilled with
"Copy of <name>", duplicates the dashboard and navigates to the copy,
showing a success notification, or a warning listing what could not be
copied. If the dashboard can't be created, an error is shown and the
dialog stays open so the user can retry.
